items.body:
Fixes the remaining staging A/B failure after CDN and UI ownership were corrected.

Root cause proven by Playwright trace from run #30819532670:
- the marked-read `notifications.php` network response contained the current pending invite and `accept/decline` actions;
- `interaction-latency-coordinator.js` returned its older 10-second notifications cache to the UI and only refreshed the correct response in the background;
- therefore the canonical renderer received old cancelled notifications despite a correct server response.

Changes:
- publishes corrected `interaction-latency-coordinator-v101.js?v=101` under a new physical object name;
- `markRead:true` notification requests now return the authoritative network response directly;
- history caching and unrelated interaction optimizations remain intact;
- publishes `main.js?v=98.2`;
- fixes `v110.php` to replace the exact active main URL without leaking `.2` into `main-v110.js?v=1124`;
- adds focused regression contracts.

Exact tested head: `c96b67b50d5dfb0b216e754f6c1079da4c36f369`

Validation:
- Mini Games World CI #1396 — SUCCESS
- DB Primary Staging Entrypoint Selector Safety #502 — SUCCESS

No production deploy, database, economy, auth, game-rule or payment changes. Target is staging only.
